James received an inquiry from Md. Salman Arefin Alif, a prospective graduate student interested in the Master of Science in Marine Studies at the University of Delaware, specifically regarding research opportunities in oceanography. Alif detailed his background in geology, climate modeling, and his previous manuscript work. James's response clarified that he is not involved in the oceanography program and recommended Alif contact faculty within that program. He offered to provide guidance related to his own research domains and encouraged Alif to schedule a conversation using a provided link.
